m of the page)</li>\n<li>Ten counters (you can use pieces of pasta, buttons or something else!)</li>\n</ul>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 81348952, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 66427522, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2>You will need:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Two dice (or use the dice at the bottom of the page)</li>\n<li>Ten counters (you can use pieces of pasta, buttons or something else!)</li>\n</ul>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 66427742, "text": "<ol>\n<li>Make sure each player has five counters.</li>\n<li>Each player rolls their die.</li>\n<li>Each player says the number they have rolled. You can count the spots if you're not sure!</li>\n<li>The winner is the person with the fewest dots - who has won?</li>\n<li>The winner says this sentence: \"I have won because ___ is less than ___.\"</li>\n<li>The loser gives the winner one of their counters.</li>\n<li>Keep playing until one person has all the counters!</li>\n</ol>\n<br></br>\n<b>What if we roll the same number?</b>\n<br>Just roll again!", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 5, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 66427522, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 66427742, "text": "<ol>\n<li>Make sure each player has five counters.</li>\n<li>Each player rolls their die.</li>\n<li>Each player says the number they have rolled. You can count the spots if you're not sure!</li>\n<li>The winner is the person with the fewest dots - who has won?</li>\n<li>The winner says this sentence: \"I have won because ___ is less than ___.\"</li>\n<li>The loser gives the winner one of their counters.</li>\n<li>Keep playing until one person has all the counters!</li>\n</ol>\n<br></br>\n<b>What if we roll the same number?</b>\n<br>Just roll again!", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 5, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 66427522, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": fa